meta {
  name: Create User
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/user
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "institute_id": "{{instituteId}}",
    "name": "Juan",
    "lastName": "Pérez",
    "email": "juan.perez@example.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "status": "1",
    "rol": "USER",
    "documentType": "DNI",
    "documentNumber": "12345678",
    "gender": "M"
  }
}

docs {
  **Public**. Crea un usuario. El controller usa el cmd legacy `createUser` (camelCase).

  Status: `1=ACTIVE | 2=INACTIVE | 3=PENDING | 4=SUSPENDED | 5=DELETED`.
  Rol: `SUPERADMIN | USER | EMPLOYEE`.

  ## Errores
  - 409: email o DNI ya existente
  - 400: instituto no existe
}
